["<aside class=\"callout why\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>Cold and wet end hunts early. Dress in layers you add and remove: you stay out, quiet and safe.</p></aside>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Deer hunter dressed head to toe: toque, blaze orange vest over a quiet shell, layers underneath with no cotton, two pairs of gloves, quiet pants, insulated broken in boots with wool or synthetic socks.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Dressed for a cold deer hunt</text>\n  <!-- figure -->\n  <path d=\"M182 46 Q 200 30 218 46 L218 54 L182 54 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"64\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#d9b48f\"/>\n  <path d=\"M170 82 L230 82 L242 170 L158 170 Z\" fill=\"#6b6f48\"/>\n  <path d=\"M176 84 L224 84 L230 150 L170 150 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <path d=\"M170 84 L150 150 L160 154 L178 100 Z M230 84 L250 150 L240 154 L222 100 Z\" fill=\"#6b6f48\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"153\" cy=\"158\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><circle cx=\"247\" cy=\"158\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <path d=\"M162 170 L238 170 L232 256 L206 256 L200 196 L194 256 L168 256 Z\" fill=\"#5c5a4a\"/>\n  <path d=\"M164 256 L198 256 L198 278 L156 278 Z M202 256 L236 256 L244 278 L202 278 Z\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/>\n  <!-- labels -->\n  <g stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"><line x1=\"182\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"46\"/><line x1=\"185\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"100\"/><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"150\"/><line x1=\"153\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"200\"/><line x1=\"236\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"90\"/><line x1=\"226\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"190\"/><line x1=\"236\" y1=\"268\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"262\"/></g>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"end\">\n    <text x=\"106\" y=\"50\" fill=\"#e8590c\">Orange toque</text><text x=\"106\" y=\"104\" fill=\"#e8590c\">Orange vest</text><text x=\"106\" y=\"148\">Quiet shell</text><text x=\"106\" y=\"196\">2 pairs gloves</text>\n  </g>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">\n    <text x=\"284\" y=\"86\">Layers under:</text><text x=\"284\" y=\"104\" font-weight=\"normal\">no cotton</text>\n    <text x=\"284\" y=\"188\">Quiet pants</text>\n    <text x=\"284\" y=\"258\">Broken in boots</text><text x=\"284\" y=\"276\" font-weight=\"normal\">wool socks</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Four layers: <strong>base, mid, insulation, shell</strong> <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>. No cotton next to skin (Tip).</li><li>Boots and socks matter more than any jacket (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the full key points</summary><ul><li>Four layers: <strong>base, mid, insulation, shell</strong> <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>No cotton next to skin. It holds water and chills you (Tip).</li><li>Kamloops in late October: cold mornings, possible snow. Assumption: below freezing at dawn. <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> the forecast.</li><li>Mission and the Fraser Valley: rain is the enemy. A real waterproof shell matters most (Tip).</li><li>Boots and socks matter more than any jacket (Tip).</li><li>The 2026 to 2028 BC <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</button> contains no hunter orange requirement <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">90%</span>. Wear blaze orange anyway in deer season: a strong safety tip (Tip).</li><li>Your sizes: boots 9 regular, waders medium, jacket medium, gloves medium.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 440\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"440\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Four layers, inside to outside</text>\n  <!-- body -->\n  <rect x=\"20\" y=\"50\" width=\"40\" height=\"370\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#6b4f35\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"40\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" transform=\"rotate(-90 40 240)\">Skin</text>\n  <!-- layers -->\n  <rect x=\"64\" y=\"50\" width=\"22\" height=\"370\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"90\" y=\"50\" width=\"30\" height=\"370\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"124\" y=\"50\" width=\"44\" height=\"370\" fill=\"#6b4f35\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"172\" y=\"50\" width=\"20\" height=\"370\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <!-- labels -->\n  <text x=\"206\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\">1. Base</text>\n  <text x=\"206\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\">Thin wool or synthetic.</text>\n  <text x=\"206\" y=\"118\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\">Moves sweat off skin.</text>\n  <line x1=\"75\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/>\n\n  <text x=\"206\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\">2. Mid</text>\n  <text x=\"206\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\">Fleece or wool.</text>\n  <text x=\"206\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\">Warm while walking.</text>\n  <line x1=\"105\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/>\n\n  <text x=\"206\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\">3. Insulation</text>\n  <text x=\"206\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\">Puffy jacket.</text>\n  <text x=\"206\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\">On when you sit still.</text>\n  <line x1=\"146\" y1=\"270\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/>\n\n  <text x=\"206\" y=\"350\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\">4. Shell</text>\n  <text x=\"206\" y=\"370\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\">Blocks wind and rain.</text>\n  <text x=\"206\" y=\"388\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\">Waterproof for Mission.</text>\n  <line x1=\"182\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/>\n  <text x=\"296\" y=\"432\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No cotton in any layer.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><figure class=\"diagram anim\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Animation: a hunter walks in wearing only base and mid layers, a little cool, puffy jacket in the pack. At the glassing spot the hunter sits down and puts the puffy on to stay warm while still.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Walk cool. Puffy on when you stop.</text>\n  <path d=\"M0 250 Q 120 230 220 236 T 400 220 L400 300 L0 300 Z\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\"/>\n  <ellipse cx=\"320\" cy=\"226\" rx=\"40\" ry=\"14\" fill=\"#8a8f88\"/>\n  <g>\n    <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"0 0;250 -22\" dur=\"4s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <g>\n      <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"0 0;0 0;0 12\" keyTimes=\"0;0.8;1\" dur=\"5s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"170\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#d9b48f\"/>\n      <rect x=\"48\" y=\"182\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/>\n      <rect x=\"70\" y=\"186\" width=\"14\" height=\"24\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/>\n      <rect x=\"44\" y=\"180\" width=\"32\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e8590c\" opacity=\"0\">\n        <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"5s\" dur=\".8s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n      </rect>\n      <g stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n        <line x1=\"54\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"48\" y2=\"246\"><animate attributeName=\"x2\" values=\"44;62;44;62;44;62;44;62;48\" dur=\"4s\" fill=\"freeze\"/></line>\n        <line x1=\"66\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"246\"><animate attributeName=\"x2\" values=\"76;58;76;58;76;58;76;58;70\" dur=\"4s\" fill=\"freeze\"/></line>\n      </g>\n    </g>\n  </g>\n  <g opacity=\"1\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0\" begin=\"3.6s\" dur=\".4s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <rect x=\"20\" y=\"40\" width=\"190\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Walking: base + mid</text><text x=\"115\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">puffy in the pack</text>\n  </g>\n  <g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"5.4s\" dur=\".5s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <rect x=\"180\" y=\"40\" width=\"200\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sitting: puffy on</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">stay warm while still</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n<figcaption>Walk in cool. Puffy on when you sit. <button class=\"anim-replay\">↻ Replay</button></figcaption></figure><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: what each layer does</summary><ul><li><strong>Base:</strong> thin, against skin. Moves sweat away <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li><strong>Mid:</strong> fleece or light wool. Traps warmth while you walk <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li><strong>Insulation:</strong> puffy jacket for sitting still. Pack it on the walk in, put it on when you stop (Tip).</li><li><strong>Shell:</strong> stops wind and rain. Quiet fabric for deer, fully waterproof for ducks (Tip).</li><li>Walk in cool. Start the hike a little cold, so you do not soak your base layer in sweat (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>Merino wool</th><th>Synthetic</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Warm when damp</td><td>Yes, very good <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span></td><td>Good <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Smell after days</td><td>Low <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span></td><td>Holds odour <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Dries</td><td>Slower <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span></td><td>Faster <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Durability</td><td>Lower <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td><td>Higher <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Cost</td><td>Higher <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span></td><td>Lower <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>Wool for cold sits. Synthetic for wet, active days and the budget (Tip).</li></ul>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two climates, two kits. Kamloops in the Interior: cold and possible snow, so merino base, fleece, puffy, quiet soft shell, toque and insulated boots. Mission in the Fraser Valley: rain, so synthetic base, fleece, fully waterproof jacket and pants, waders or rubber boots.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"198\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" opacity=\".5\"/>\n  <rect x=\"202\" y=\"0\" width=\"198\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" opacity=\".12\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"99\" y=\"26\">Kamloops: cold</text><text x=\"301\" y=\"26\">Mission: wet</text></g>\n  <g fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"50\" r=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"60\" r=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"90\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"100\" r=\"3\"/></g>\n  <g stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"230\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"226\" y2=\"56\"/><line x1=\"370\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"366\" y2=\"62\"/><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"246\" y2=\"102\"/><line x1=\"356\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"352\" y2=\"108\"/></g>\n  <!-- cold figure -->\n  <path d=\"M86 52 Q 99 40 112 52 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><circle cx=\"99\" cy=\"62\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#d9b48f\"/>\n  <rect x=\"78\" y=\"74\" width=\"42\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#6b6f48\"/>\n  <rect x=\"80\" y=\"134\" width=\"38\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#5c5a4a\"/><rect x=\"76\" y=\"184\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><rect x=\"100\" y=\"184\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/>\n  <!-- wet figure -->\n  <path d=\"M286 64 Q 301 40 316 64 Z\" fill=\"#2f6b3a\"/><circle cx=\"301\" cy=\"64\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#d9b48f\"/>\n  <rect x=\"280\" y=\"74\" width=\"42\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#2f6b3a\"/>\n  <rect x=\"282\" y=\"120\" width=\"38\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#4a5a3a\"/><rect x=\"278\" y=\"184\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">\n    <text x=\"12\" y=\"224\">Merino base</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"242\">Fleece, puffy</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"260\">Quiet soft shell</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"278\">Insulated boots</text>\n    <text x=\"214\" y=\"224\">Synthetic base</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"242\">Fleece mid</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"260\" font-weight=\"bold\">Waterproof shell</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"278\">Waders, rubber boots</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Interior: warm. Fraser Valley: <strong>fully waterproof</strong> (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: both kits in full</summary><h4>BC Interior near Kamloops</h4><ul><li>Merino base, fleece mid, puffy insulation, quiet soft shell (Tip).</li><li>Toque, neck gaiter, warm gloves plus a spare pair (Tip).</li><li>Insulated leather boots for snow and frozen ground (Tip).</li></ul><h4>Wet Fraser Valley near Mission</h4><ul><li>Synthetic base, fleece mid, <strong>fully waterproof</strong> shell jacket and pants (Tip).</li><li>Waders for the marsh. Rubber boots for walking field edges (Tip).</li><li>Spare dry layer in a dry bag in the car (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Three kinds of footwear. Insulated waterproof leather boot, about 400 grams of insulation, for Interior deer. Tall rubber boot for walking wet field edges. Chest waders for the duck marsh. Break boots in for a week with your hunting socks.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pick the boot for the hunt</text>\n  <path d=\"M40 90 L90 90 L92 170 L130 182 L132 206 L36 206 Z\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"36\" y=\"200\" width=\"96\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <path d=\"M170 60 L214 60 L216 172 L250 182 L252 206 L166 206 Z\" fill=\"#2f6b3a\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"166\" y=\"200\" width=\"86\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <path d=\"M296 50 L366 50 L370 120 L360 176 L388 186 L388 206 L300 206 L300 176 L292 120 Z\" fill=\"#5c5a4a\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <path d=\"M300 50 L310 36 M362 50 L352 36\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <rect x=\"300\" y=\"200\" width=\"88\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"84\" y=\"234\">Insulated</text><text x=\"208\" y=\"234\">Tall rubber</text><text x=\"342\" y=\"234\">Waders</text></g>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"84\" y=\"252\">Interior deer</text><text x=\"84\" y=\"268\">about 400 g</text><text x=\"208\" y=\"252\">field edges</text><text x=\"342\" y=\"252\">duck marsh</text></g>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Break in a week, in your hunting socks (Tip)</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Spare merino or synthetic socks in a zip bag (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: boot details</summary><ul><li>Deer, Interior: insulated waterproof leather boot, about 400 g insulation for cold sits (Tip).</li><li>Ducks, Fraser Valley: waders or tall rubber boots (Tip).</li><li>Break new boots in for a week before the hunt. Wear the socks you will hunt in (Tip).</li><li>Merino or synthetic socks. Bring a spare pair in a zip bag (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Wader belt. Without a belt, a fall lets water rush down into the legs. With a belt cinched at the waist, water coming in is slowed. In a boat or kayak, wear a PFD over the waders.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Always cinch a wader belt</text>\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"150\" width=\"400\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n  <!-- no belt -->\n  <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"66\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#d9b48f\"/>\n  <path d=\"M74 82 L126 82 L130 250 L104 250 L100 170 L96 250 L70 250 Z\" fill=\"#5c5a4a\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <path d=\"M73 150 L127 150 L130 250 L104 250 L100 170 L96 250 L70 250 Z\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" opacity=\".8\"/>\n  <path d=\"M84 90 q 6 20 -2 40 M116 90 q -6 20 2 40\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\"/>\n  <!-- belt -->\n  <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"66\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#d9b48f\"/>\n  <path d=\"M274 82 L326 82 L330 250 L304 250 L300 170 L296 250 L270 250 Z\" fill=\"#5c5a4a\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"270\" y=\"132\" width=\"60\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><rect x=\"294\" y=\"130\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"100\" y=\"278\" fill=\"#c0392b\">No belt ✗</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"278\" fill=\"#2f6b3a\">Belt on ✓</text></g>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"100\" y=\"296\">water rushes in</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"296\">slows the water</text></g>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">In a boat:</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">PFD over waders</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Always a <strong>wader belt</strong>, cinched. It slows water rushing in if you fall <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>In the boat or kayak: <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"PFD\">PFD</button> (personal flotation device) over your waders (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: neoprene vs breathable, fit</summary><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>Neoprene</th><th>Breathable</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Warmth</td><td>Warmer in cold water <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td><td>Need layers underneath <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Walking</td><td>Heavier, hot on long walks <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td><td>Lighter, easier to walk <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Durability</td><td>Tougher <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td><td>Punctures easier, easy to patch <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Drying</td><td>Slow. Needs a boot dryer for back to back days <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td><td>Faster <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Price</td><td>Cheaper for warm options <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td><td>Good ones cost more <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>Bootfoot waders: check the boot size too. Try size 9 with thick socks (Tip).</li><li>Fit for \"medium\" varies by brand. Try them on in store (Tip).</li><li>The water safety session has more.</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>When</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Thin gloves</td><td>Shooting</td><td>Feel the trigger (Tip)</td></tr><tr><td>Warm mitts</td><td>Sitting</td><td>Warm hands (Tip)</td></tr><tr><td>Neoprene gloves</td><td>Decoys</td><td>Waterproof (Tip)</td></tr><tr><td>Toque</td><td>Cold</td><td>Warm head (Tip)</td></tr><tr><td>Brimmed cap</td><td>Rain</td><td>Dry glasses (Tip)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>BC: no orange rule <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">90%</span>. Wear an orange vest and toque on the walk in and out (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: orange rules by province</summary><ul><li>Two pairs of gloves: thin shooting gloves, plus warm mitts or waterproof gloves for sitting (Tip).</li><li>Duck gloves: waterproof neoprene for setting decoys (Tip).</li><li>Toque in cold. Brimmed cap in rain keeps water off your glasses (Tip).</li></ul><aside class=\"callout law\"><div class=\"callout-t\">The rule</div><p><strong>BC:</strong> the 2026 to 2028 Synopsis contains no hunter orange requirement <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">90%</span>. Not required, but still a strong safety tip (Tip). <strong>Ontario:</strong> hunters must wear at least 400 sq in (2,580 sq cm) of solid hunter orange plus orange headwear in gun seasons for deer, moose and elk <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>. <strong>Alberta:</strong> one secondary source says no colour requirement <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">60%</span>. <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span>.</p></aside><ul><li>Deer season on <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Crown land\">Crown land</button> near Kamloops: orange vest and toque on the walk in and out (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Simplified picture of colour vision. To you, a blaze orange vest is bright. To a deer, orange looks much like green and blends in, while blue jeans stand out. Wear orange for safety, skip blue, and sit still.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"100\" y=\"24\">What you see</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"24\">What a deer sees</text></g>\n  <rect x=\"10\" y=\"36\" width=\"180\" height=\"210\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#6b8a4a\" opacity=\".5\"/>\n  <rect x=\"210\" y=\"36\" width=\"180\" height=\"210\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#9a9a7a\" opacity=\".5\"/>\n  <!-- you view -->\n  <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"74\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#d9b48f\"/><path d=\"M88 60 Q 100 50 112 60 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <path d=\"M78 90 L122 90 L126 160 L74 160 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <path d=\"M76 160 L124 160 L120 234 L102 234 L100 186 L98 234 L80 234 Z\" fill=\"#3a6fc0\"/>\n  <g transform=\"translate(-24 0)\"><!-- deer view -->\n  <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"74\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#b5b29a\"/><path d=\"M288 60 Q 300 50 312 60 Z\" fill=\"#9a9a6a\"/>\n  <path d=\"M278 90 L322 90 L326 160 L274 160 Z\" fill=\"#9a9a6a\"/>\n  <path d=\"M276 160 L324 160 L320 234 L302 234 L300 186 L298 234 L280 234 Z\" fill=\"#2d5fd0\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">\n    <text x=\"130\" y=\"126\">Bright</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"120\">Blends</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"138\" font-weight=\"normal\">like green</text>\n    <text x=\"308\" y=\"200\" fill=\"#2d5fd0\">Blue</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"218\" fill=\"#2d5fd0\">stands out</text>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Wear orange. Skip blue. Sit still.</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Simplified colours</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Deer cannot tell orange from green <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>. Avoid blue in deer country (Tip).</li><li>Stillness beats camo pattern (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: deer, ducks and fabric</summary><ul><li>Deer see blue and yellow well. They cannot tell orange from green <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>. Orange keeps you safe and still blends for deer <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>Avoid blue jeans and blue jackets in deer country (Tip).</li><li>Pattern and stillness matter more than the exact camo (Tip).</li><li>Ducks see colour well. Use dull marsh tones and hide your face and hands (Tip).</li><li>Earth tones (brown, olive, grey) work for most hunts if you sit still (Tip).</li><li>Choose quiet fabrics. Stiff nylon rustles in brush (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Entry</th><th>Mid</th><th>Premium</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Rain suit or shell</td><td>Frogg Toggs All Sport Rain Suit, $79.95 to $93 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td><td>Sitka Dew Point jacket, $449 to $500 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Insulated hunting boot</td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td><td>Irish Setter VaprTrek 400 g, $244.99 to $259.95 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td><td>Kenetrek Mountain Extreme 400, $835 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Blaze orange</td><td>Huntshield vest and cap set, $44.99 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">60%</span></td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>CAD (Canadian dollars). Price checked 2026-10-01. Search preview prices, verify at checkout. Sizes: jacket M, boots 9 regular.</li></ul>","<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Entry</th><th>Mid</th><th>Premium</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Chest waders</td><td>Outbound neoprene bootfoot, $199.99 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">60%</span></td><td>Banded RedZone breathable insulated, CAD <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td><td>Sitka Delta Zip, $1,499.99 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Merino base layer</td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td></tr><tr><td>Fleece mid, puffy</td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td></tr><tr><td>Gloves</td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td></tr><tr><td>Wader belt</td><td>Often included with waders (Tip)</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>Price checked 2026-10-01. Verify at checkout. Sizes: waders M, gloves M.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: price note</summary><ul><li>Base layer prices found only in US dollars. Canadian price: <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> in store.</li><li>Search preview prices, verify at checkout.</li></ul></details>","<aside class=\"callout lean\"><div class=\"callout-t\">My lean (opinion)</div><p>Spend on <strong>boots, waders and a waterproof shell</strong>. Go cheap on base and mid layers to start. Upgrade what fails, not what is fine.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout rule\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Be bold, start cold. You warm up in 10 minutes of walking.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Cotton hoodie and jeans in the rain.</li><li>New boots on day one. Blisters by noon.</li><li>Waders with no belt.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Night before: put on the full kit and walk 20 minutes. Fix what rubs or rustles.</p></aside>","<ul><li>Orange rule: whole BC Synopsis searched <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">90%</span>. Clothing and vision facts: secondary sources (60 to 70%).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: all sources</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/assets/gov/sports-recreation-arts-and-culture/outdoor-recreation/fishing-and-hunting/hunting/regulations/hunting-trapping-synopsis.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BC Hunting and Trapping Regulations Synopsis 2026 to 2028</a>, read directly. All 84 pages searched for \"orange\" and \"blaze\", covers checked by image: no hunter orange requirement. Checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">90%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://bcfirearmsacademy.ca/what-gear-do-i-need-for-my-first-hunt-in-bc-bc-firearms-academy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BC Firearms Academy: gear for a first BC hunt</a>, blaze orange not required, checked 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.outdoorcanada.ca/opinion-why-we-should-all-wear-blaze-orange-when-hunting-big-game/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Outdoor Canada: why wear blaze orange</a>, checked 2026-10-01 (65%, opinion)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.ontario.ca/document/ontario-hunting-regulations-summary/general-regulations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ontario hunting regulations summary, general regulations</a>, hunter orange, checked 2026-10-01 (70%, search preview)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.canadiangunnutz.com/forum/threads/blaze-orange-by-province-territory.580443/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Canadian Gun Nutz: blaze orange by province</a>, Alberta, checked 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">60%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://polygiene.com/news/resources/merino-wool-vs-synthetic-base-layers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Polygiene: merino wool vs synthetic base layers</a>, checked 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.alloutdoor.com/2025/01/09/breathable-vs-neoprene-hunting-waders/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AllOutdoor: breathable vs neoprene waders</a>, checked 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.ducks.org/hunting/waterfowl-hunting-tips/when-a-duck-hunt-becomes-a-survival-situation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ducks Unlimited: when a duck hunt becomes a survival situation</a>, wader belt, checked 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.sitkagear.com/experience/what-colors-can-deer-see\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sitka: what colours can deer see</a>, University of Georgia research summary, checked 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></li><li>Prices: search previews of Kenetrek Canada, Lefebvre's, La Tulipe, Bass Pro Canada, Sail, Canadian Tire, Sports Headquarters, Royal Distributing, The Fishin' Hole, price checked 2026-10-01 (60 to 65%)</li></ul></details>"]